; claude: a GUI toolkit, from scratch, for teaching how a program is
; built around the person using it: what a widget is (Widget), where
; its colors and sizes come from (Theme), and the immediate-mode
; engine the playground's Gui is made of (Immediate). See
; docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_gui_teaching.md and notes_gui.md.
; Independent of the Playground (playground/Gui.ml is the adapter): it
; speaks rectangles and paint, not shapes and computers. A private
; library, installed as part of elm_playground: pure OCaml, so every
; backend, the web one included, can use it.
(library
 (name gui)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries elm_core) ; Color
)
